    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Farah Naz Qamar, Associate Professor and Consultant Pediatric Infectious Disease at AKU has been awarded the Tamgha-e-Imtiaz by the President of Pakistan, Dr Arif Alvi, in recognition of her contribution to public health. Tamgha-e-Imtiaz (Medal of Excellence) is the fourth highest honour given to a civilian for their achievements and contributions towards the nation.",
